rooms_desc ({"You footfalls tap surprisingly softly on the black and white marble floor tileThe shadow black adamant walls are interlaced with streaks of silvery blueand grey.  An obsidian desk is nearly lost in the shadows in one corner, And a strange glassy statue stands in another.  Two plaques, one marble andone some soft, shimmering grey substance, are affixed to the walls.  A largewindow dominates the south wall.","A silvery blue dome, spangled with jagged streaks of some reddish silver alloy,arches above you.  The streaks remind you of some strange, fiery lightning...as if the storm above fitted somebody's mood so perfectly that they left anelectric aura to permeate the room...  Your skin tingles.The room underneath the dome is divided in two.  On one half, the walls andfloor are completely composed of some glittering sky blue metalloid -- bright and smoother than silk.  The other half of the room is nearly hidden inshadows.  The dark grey-blue metal, smooth and cool to the touch, seems to absorb the light from the glowing roof almost entirely.  Each side is dominated by a long, crescent-shaped table, a black table on the sky blueside, and a gleaming white table on the dark blue side.  Both tables arepiled with documents and manuals.  And in the center of each table sits a large grey terminal.  The terminals both sport active matrix color screens,compact inkjet printers, shimmering grey-blue shells, and transparentkeyboards.  And each is running Linux...  Next to each terminal is a smallnameplate and postit pad.  The center of the room is dominated by a raiseddais.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"The lab of Den and Zeo","Den and Zeo's workroom",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
