items ({({"desk","A shadow black obsidian desk which seems to blend so well with the shadows that you would almost think that it is partly shadows itself...","plaque","Which one ?","marble plaque","One line:  'Just free your mind, and your body will follow.'","grey plaque","You can barely make out a wavering image which seems sometimes to be a reflection of something behind you....  and sometimes a picture of something coming out of the plaque itself...  something dark and light,  rational and random, silent and musical...","walls","Shadow black walls of a smooth, glossy substance that you can't quite identify","statue","A statue of Someone special.  It is composed entirely of a seamless, glasslike substance which is at once as transparent as crystal and as opaque as slate.","tiles","The marble floor tiles seem to shimmer as you step on them","floor","Silver lettering across the center of the floor reads:\\n'What are we missing.. when we go about our daily business without once bothering to glance up at the sky...  At the sun, and the birds above... TAnd the anvil plummeting down at us.","window","A window into the realm of your creations.  The view is what you make it ;>",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
